{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_04_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:095af0319477a17211c13c199df1bb7cf94bf008426b3c88d196c68b757f6dab",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e946ee7afc5792348cc3d0cd8f1a9759fa295390b428724e954955629f26b81b",
      "text": "男极‘制作部门’啊。偶像去\n制作偶像，感觉真有意思呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef9d334268516e3b79b77e9c9c3fc963aea4910756f18a78285ad5550caae850",
      "text": "辉先生他们要……制作的，\n是一位老爷爷，对吧……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac2035cfef620ccfbc271d3024fafde7ad8bbf21d62b9e71f30384d8cbd9938e",
      "text": "对。说是快70岁了。\n然后制作部门的特别节目在一个月后。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fe4cb6ca494ef61f9ddddb6de1d1ad2119490c766529fc48be49fb94ce99d38",
      "text": "好——！我也要去！\n那个特别节目，我们能去现场见学吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d243a73af0246296f0cc3a89b673ad69875b7497686dee2f7387ad1d6366bd7",
      "text": "大概没问题吧。\n我去问问●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5e436595c98910d551154e014847f40d6452e1eca84ac4bf893a8aae9e00775",
      "text": "太好啦！\n超级Giga Thank You，翼仔！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8e22e48fae5c2daf278c4b3870d80456c2c5bd25e7b2b323fd3168a8c7d6ce4",
      "text": "那么，那位老爷爷的进展如何呢？\n一个月后的话，时间也不太充裕吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d1a60013f900a135770ad59692be8bb6403d171b424a03b6c625318ec70fe89",
      "text": "今天好像是薰先生给他上声乐课来着吧。\n所以才没能来一起买东西……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d6a68e2fc52e3884788b3b37fb3f6109a049396273aca62c4c3eceabe5a6638",
      "text": "诶！是、是啊，进展嘛，这个……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1cd97d7d571f68e3c70d9c93a0fe10610c787bd10a3cc43cd751fd9afb9457f",
      "text": "哎呀～……。其实，斯巴达式的樱庭，\n和老爷爷的相性稍微有点不太合啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23744b76f0ea3d09597977e2e045f3587467bb20afe181f7a04382ba32ddf5ea",
      "text": "哈哈……。虽然他对我和辉先生的课程，\n态度都还算积极……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5002e3546d59383c78720f0ae629a442cc3b5eef288a2dac16043aa14d9aaaf2",
      "text": "但跟薰先生在一起就经常起争执呢。\n今天不知道顺不顺利啊……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:793a7a85179ca0894e486fc790e1ec2d01a794bdeea193e3304571bc0af23053",
      "text": "真是的，樱庭这家伙真让人不省心。\n去看看情况吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
